commit 036d93222ea45dbf076e492bec7d24c9937fe9aa
Author: Soumyaranjan <soumyaranjansahoo97292@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 10 00:54:14 2026 +0530

    feat(benchmark): integrate OpenCV video benchmarking pipeline and UI HUD
    
    - Python Engine: Added python-engine/video/ isolating OpenCV tracking (ideo_benchmark.py, ideo_tracker.py) from the simulation. Implemented strict PTZ P-controller physics, Kalman prediction coasting during beacon occlusion, and stdin listeners for dynamic effects.
    - Node Backend: Updated server.js to spawn the benchmark python process and accurately pipe live set_config telemetry/noise settings to the active engine.
    - React Frontend: Overhauled App.jsx with a professional camera HUD. Implemented Benchmark Mode video upload pipeline, and selective environmental disturbance controls (Image Noise, Camera Jitter, Platform Motion) that sync live with the backend. Added synthetic test video generator.

